{
  "_comment": [
    "Clide capture hooks. These POST the hook payload straight to the local daemon.",
    "",
    "type=http, not command: there is no process to spawn, so no Node startup cost per",
    "tool call. Note that `async` is a command-hook-only field and is deliberately absent",
    "here — an http hook is synchronous, which is safe because the receiver is a local",
    "in-memory server: an absent daemon refuses the connection immediately, and a hung one",
    "is bounded by the explicit timeout below (the platform default is 600s, not a budget).",
    "",
    "The token comes from $CLIDE_TOKEN. If that variable is unset the header interpolates",
    "to an empty string and every event is rejected, so the daemon counts and reports",
    "unauthorized ingest separately from silence. Run `clide install` for the export line."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": { "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN" },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["CLIDE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
